ada County runs from 1951 to 2025, 75 years, on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids. October to November and November to December each came in under 90% of normal in 37 years. In 2025 the middle saw May to June at 142% of normal and November to December at 43%. So far in 2026, January to February came in at 48% and February to March at 42%.</p>"}
